16:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4","children":"Kalkulyatordan qanday foydalanish"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-sm sm:prose-base max-w-none text-muted-foreground space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Kalkulyator qanday ishlaydi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"O'zbekistonda avtolizing — «Lizing to'g'risida»gi qonun bilan tartibga solingan, keyinchalik sotib olish huquqi bilan transport vositasini ijaraga olishdir. Uzautolizing, O'zlizing, Imkon Lizing va boshqa lizing kompaniyalari avtomobil markasi, shartnoma muddati va avans miqdoriga qarab yillik 18% dan 26% gacha stavkalar taklif etadi. Minimal avans odatda transport vositasi qiymatining 20–30% ini tashkil etadi."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Hisoblash formulasi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Avtolizingning "}],["$","$Lc","1",{"href":"/uz/calculator/avtokredit","localeCookie":"$3:props:children:props:children:props:children:0:props:localeCookie","className":"text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline underline-offset-2 decoration-emerald-500/40 font-medium","children":"avtokredit"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":" dan asosiy farqi shundaki, avtomobil to'liq sotib olingunga qadar lizing kompaniyasi balansida qoladi. Biznes uchun bu foydali: lizing to'lovlari to'liq xarajatlarga kiritiladi va soliqqa tortiladigan foydani kamaytiradi. Bundan tashqari, 3 gacha koeffitsientli tezlashtirilgan amortizatsiya qo'llaniladi, bu aktivning qiymatini tezroq hisobdan chiqarish imkonini beradi. Lizing to'lovlari bo'yicha "}],["$","$Lc","3",{"href":"/uz/calculator/qqs","localeCookie":"$3:props:children:prop